# Project Scope (String Reverser)

## Goal
Build a single web page that reverses an input string and displays the result.

## Constraints
- Use ONLY the provided seed files:
  - `template/index.html`
  - `template/script.js`
- Do not add new files.
- No frameworks, no external libraries.

## Deliverable
- A working UI with:
  - text input
  - "Reverse" button
  - result area
- JavaScript logic implemented in `script.js`.